      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\begin{cases}x_0=A\\cos\\varphi,\\\\↵v_0=-A\\omega\\sin\\varphi.\\end{cases}\\qquad(10)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把方程组（10）写成",
        "$\\begin{cases}x_0=A\\cos\\varphi,\\\\↵-\\frac{v_0}{\\omega}=A\\sin\\varphi.\\end{cases}\\qquad(10\\text{а})$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，",
        "$A=\\sqrt{x_0^2+\\left(\\frac{v_0}{\\omega}\\right)^2}.\\qquad(11)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "常数 $A$ 和 $\\varphi$ 实质上不是别的，而是具有坐标 $x_0$ 和 $\\frac{v_0}{\\omega}$ 的向",
        "量 $\\vec{r}\\left(x_0,\\frac{v_0}{\\omega}\\right)^{*}$ 的长度和它同横坐标轴所成的角度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "便于求 $\\varphi$ 的公式",
        "$\\operatorname{tg}\\frac{\\varphi}{2}=-\\frac{v_0}{\\omega(x_0+A)}\\qquad(12)$",
        "将在第90小节里论证（参看第259题）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在小球的问题里，我们得到了普遍结果. $\\blacktriangleleft$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了从谐振动方程（1）无穷多个解的集合中挑选出一个",
        "唯一解，可以给出初始条件：",
        "$f(0)=f_0,\\quad f'(0)=f'_0.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在 $c>0$，$f_0$ 和 $f'_0$ 这些数据下，方程",
        "$f''(t)=-cf(t)$",
        "有一个且仅有一个解. 在任何其他的点 $t_0$，也可以给出“初",
        "始条件”",
        "$f(t_0)=f_0,\\quad f'(t_0)=f'_0.$"
      ]
    },
